<section class="site-section" id="key-practices">
  <div class="container">
    <h1 class="section-heading">Key Practices</h1>
    <p class="section-description">
      Below are the key practices I believe are essential for building great
      software and great teams.
    </p>
    <div class="row">
      <div class="col-12 col-xs-offset-1 col-md-4 col-md-offset-1">
        <h4 class="left-sub-heading">Creativity</h4>
        <p class="section-description left top-1">
          Thinking about the problem differently often leads to creative solutions.
        </p>
        <h4 class="left-sub-heading">Empathy</h4>
        <p class="section-description left top-1">
          Caring about the <em>why</em> for the people you're building for is
          what separates good work from great work.
        </p>
        <h4 class="left-sub-heading">Clear Communication</h4>
        <p class="section-description left top-1">
          Delivering precise and meaningful context effectively keeps teams
          aligned and decisions reversible.
        </p>
        <h4 class="left-sub-heading">Good Judgment</h4>
        <p class="section-description left top-1">
          Weighing the consequences of a direction well ensures the right
          decision is made, not just the obvious one.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="col-12 col-xs-offset-1 col-md-4 col-md-offset-2">
        <h4 class="left-sub-heading">Critical Thinking</h4>
        <p class="section-description left top-1">
          Considering a problem from multiple angles helps identify the real
          issue, not just the presenting symptom.
        </p>
        <h4 class="left-sub-heading">Passion</h4>
        <p class="section-description left top-1">
          Focusing on the problem rather than the solution always returns
          better results.
        </p>
        <h4 class="left-sub-heading">Thoroughness</h4>
        <p class="section-description left top-1">
          Clear goals and context enable comprehensive work without
          over-engineering.
        </p>
        <h4 class="left-sub-heading">Personal Development</h4>
        <p class="section-description left top-1">
          The ability to self-reflect and update your priors is vital to
          growth over a long career.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
